    "https://msmu.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=55318": {
      "title": "Adjunct Clinical Faculty TBSN/ABSN/RN-BSN/MSN",
      "description": "Mount Saint Mary's University\nJob Posting: Adjunct Clinical Faculty TBSN/ABSN/RN-BSN/MSN Mount Saint Mary's University \n\tJob Posting: Adjunct Clinical Faculty TBSN/ABSN/RN-BSN/MSN Title Home Human Resources Returning Applicant Login Previous Next Careers > Search Jobs > Search Results > Job Details Adjunct Clinical Faculty TBSN/ABSN/RN-BSN/MSN Category: Faculty Subscribe: New Job Alerts RSS Job Feed Locations: Los Angeles, CA Posted: Dec 1, 2014 Closes: Open Until Filled Type: Part-time Position ID: 55318 Share Job Description: Position Range: $2,998 - $11,992 per course depending on course Requirements: Registered Nurse with a current and active California license; BSN required; MSN preferred for ABSN/TBSN/RN-BSN MSN required; Doctorate preferred for MSN Must meet the following California BRN requirement: 1425(c)(2) Direct patient care experience within the previous five (5) years in the nursing area to which he or she is assigned, which can be met by: (A) One (1) year's continuous, full-time or its equivalent experience providing direct patient care as a registered nurse in the designated nursing area; or (B) One (1) academic year  of registered nurse level clinical teaching experience in the designated nursing area or its equivalent. BRN approval required for employment. One-year teaching experience preferred. Include two professional references with your resume A campus visit may be required during the clinical rotation at either one of our campuses. Travel to assigned clinical site Application Instructions: Our adjunct faculty needs vary throughout the academic year and applications are continually reviewed to meet the needs of our programs.  Interested persons are encouraged to submit their resume by clicking the Apply Now link below. Applicants must be able to provide proof of eligibility to work in the United States. The University will not assist applicants with any visa matters. A background check will be required. Employees may disclose their COVID-19 vaccination status with MSMU's Human Resources on a voluntary basis. Some MSMU clinical healthcare partners may require proof of COVID-19 vaccination to work at their facilities. If required, your academic division will inform you. Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) Powered by Hide Main Navigation Chalon Campus, WEST LA 12001 Chalon Road Los Angeles, CA 90049 Doheny Campus, DOWNTOWN LA 10 Chester Place Los Angeles, CA 90007"
